      "representative_excerpt": "So that means if the vehicle decides to do something that will put your life in danger you can't do anything to stop the vehicle? This is more dangerous that you realize putting all the trusts on automated system that have caused accidents and put people life on risk. Keep a way to stop the vehicle if the automated system fails a manual way not electronic....",
