      "representative_excerpt": "If anything over the years electronic vehicles have proven to be incredibly and increasingly unpredictable. Taking away the ability for human input puts every person on the street at risk. And allowing vehicles to be made fully autonomous with no steering wheels is just absurd. I hope the DOT wakes up and realizes how dangerous this idea is....",
